# Loaded automatically by Vite for the "test" mode Vitest runs under — overrides .env.local's
# real backend URL so axios in tests builds relative URLs (e.g. /api/vault) that MSW's handlers
# (registered with relative paths, matching the app's own api/*.js modules) can match directly,
# instead of every test needing a wildcard/absolute-origin handler pattern.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=
